  <diagram id="tablecache-request-flows" name="TableCache request flows" tablecacheTitle="TableCache request flows" tablecacheDescription="Read hits use tag and databank state without memory traffic. Read misses create fill context and may write back a dirty victim. Writes choose a direct or read-modify-write path. Cache-maintenance requests classify by tag or physical way before acknowledging completion.">
